# GitHub OAuth App credentials for the Decap CMS admin (/admin).
#
# 1. Create an OAuth App: https://github.com/settings/developers → "New OAuth App"
#      Application name:            taif.codes CMS
#      Homepage URL:               https://www.taif.codes
#      Authorization callback URL: https://www.taif.codes/api/callback
# 2. Copy the Client ID, generate a Client Secret.
# 3. Add BOTH in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#    (Production + Preview). They are read by /api/auth and /api/callback.
#
# Never commit real values — keep them only in Vercel / a local untracked .env.

OAUTH_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
OAUTH_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
